It's an exellent point.  I only start thinking about lujvo creaton when I'm
trying to think of how to translate an english word.  But that seems like
such a waste.  If that's the only reason that we use for making lujvo then
we're going to just fill the ze'a jvoca'u with glico translations.

ca lo filjvocedra ma'a .e'u finti so'i to'e purci pensi je facki valsi
